/target
# Fixture workspaces resolve their own graphs during integration tests; keep any
# build output they produce out of version control (the Cargo.lock files stay).
tests/fixtures/**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# bv (beads viewer) local config and caches
.bv/

# cargo-mutants sweep artefacts, regenerated by every run. These MUST be
# ignored: the mutation-triage green stamp is keyed to a fingerprint that
# hashes every untracked, non-ignored file, so leaving them visible makes the
# sweep invalidate the stamp taken moments before it — silently dropping the
# `--baseline skip` the stamp exists to authorise.
/mutants.out
/mutants.out.old
